add(r'\Gamma;\quad\mathbf\Gamma', 'Capital Gamma, with doubled/outlined form only where the second stem is visible.', '077–100; doubled forms 084–085', 'The first action Gamma on 084 and first product Gamma on 085 have separately visible parallel stems. Later single-stem signs on the same pages are plain. No distinct group identity is inferred from the font.')
add(r'\mathcal G', 'Rounded ornate capital G.', '085–087', 'Five specimens on 085 and two each on 086 and 087 have the broad outer loop with an inward or upper return. They are distinct from angular Gamma; the simpler fourth specimen on 085 is still part of the same notation.')
add(r'\mathcal C,\mathcal C^{\prime},\widetilde{\mathcal C}', 'Ornate open C, with each prime or tilde retained separately.', '091–098', 'The long upper flourish can resemble T, but the lower curve is open and rounded. Every live groupoid occurrence was checked on these pages. C’s repeated T readings on 094 and 097 are corrected. Crossed upper ornaments remain doubtful where necessary.')
