add(r'l,\ell;\quad u', 'Path letter has a tall loop; action argument u is a low open wave.', '077–086, 099', 'The paired formulas on 084 confirm both small f(l) labels against adjacent u arguments. The tiny g subscript on 099 still admits ell or e and remains explicitly doubtful.')
